    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52964" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάμῑλος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rope</i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				1030
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i> (Perh. coined as an emendation of the phrase 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐκοπώτερόν ἐστι κάμηλον διὰ
					τρυπήματος ῥαφίδος διελθεῖν ἢ πλούσιον εἰς τὴν
					βασιλείαν τοῦ θεοῦ εἰσελθεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
					19.24
				</span></i>
			: but cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arab.
			</span></i>
			<i>jummal</i> 'ship's cable'.)</div>
